Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:01.58,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.26,0:00:03.06,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:06.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.65,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:11.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,和大西洋聯邦締結新的同盟條約？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:13.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這種時候怎麼還說這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:16.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,正因為這種時期 首相
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.59,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,理念雖然重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:22.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但我們現在更應該與誰分擔痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:27.36,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,請首相再三思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:31.20,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那次墜落的真相大家都知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.19,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他們其中一個人說了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:38.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,「忘記被無情粉碎的生命哀號」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:41.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,「為何還與罪魁禍首在虛偽的世界發笑」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:43.19,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,「你們這些傢伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:46.29,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我去一次PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:50.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但現在還有那樣被父親...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:53.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,被父親的話蒙蔽的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.17,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:01:00.14,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但是抱歉 現在瑪尤不能接聽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:04.43,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,稍後聯繫 請在信號音後留下姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,慰靈碑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:19.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:21.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,一定是哪里搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.02,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不 沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:29.72,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,方才以大西洋聯邦和歐亞為首的聯合國
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:33.02,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,發表了「以下要求未被接受的情況下」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.69,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,「即視PLANT為地球人類的最惡性敵對國」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:41.10,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,「並不惜以武力將其清除」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.01,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這樣的共同聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:23.09,SP SEED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(649.333,626.667)}月面 地球軍Arzachel基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:23.49,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,集裝箱目錄R34到R42裝貨完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:28.75,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,搭乘艾達諾夫的MS機師請到第35待機室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:34.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第34到第37升降機在17時到18時期間封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:38.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第608班穿梭機抵達12號閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:42.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第四DaggerL的補充部件完成搬入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:50.41,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真不像話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.71,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,PLANT政府
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.21,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼解釋他們才會明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼也不會明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:02.53,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,看他們一開始就沒有這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:06.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,事到如今還說什麼逮捕移送恐怖分子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:10.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,早有消息說全員死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:13.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦不是也已經知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,再加上賠償款和解除武裝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現政權的解體
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:23.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,派遣聯合理事國最高議會監察員
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,完全不是正常的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:33.01,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他們也沒認為我們會接受這些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,關鍵是藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:39.69,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,是那些視PLANT為眼中釘的傢伙在煽動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:43.32,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼人類在宇宙中的邪惡敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:50.43,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但再怎麼說這也太無謀了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:54.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,聯合真打算這樣擴大爭端嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:58.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在這麼做應該是他們不利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:02.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但眼下他們不是這麼聲明了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:05.03,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,月球的兵力並未損失
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:08.27,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,受害大的區域集中在赤道周邊地區
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦和歐亞大陸都兵力充沛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.74,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,打仗的話還能促進消費
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:18.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,有明確的仇敵還會鬥志高漲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.44,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,和以前完全沒變 是人類社會的體制
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但這也太...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:28.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,想打的是他們 不是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:39.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.13,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,懦弱的話會被小看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:45.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,總之我們也立刻採取臨戰戒備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不 那也太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:51.22,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,請鎮靜一下 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,雖然明白你們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:59.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但我們如果回應的話又會重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不論聯合說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:06.49,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們都必須堅持以對話的方式解決
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:13.57,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不然上次戰爭中犧牲的同胞將無法瞑目
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:20.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但月球的地球軍基地已經有動靜了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:24.04,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,理念固然不錯 但事態已然達到紅色等級
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.97,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,當然必須進入迎擊狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:34.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,出動軍隊的話市民會產生恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.87,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,也會刺激地球軍方面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:39.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:41.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但也無可奈何了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:48.45,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們心中至今還存有對血之情人節的恐懼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:04.32,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,防禦策略交給國防委員會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:10.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,同時我們也必須全力尋求對話解決的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這種形式下發生戰事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:33.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,會正中那些扔下Junius7的恐怖分子下懷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:42.29,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,請切記
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:55.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿雷克斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,抱歉 情況如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不太樂觀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:03.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,PLANT市民都怨氣十足
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:09.31,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長雖然堅持以對話形式解決
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:14.86,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但也有人指責他辦事懦弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:20.33,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,作為阿斯哈首相的特使
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:23.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,立刻為你申請了面談時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:26.89,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但這種情況下不知能否順利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:28.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:54.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,然後呢 具體何時開始攻擊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:57.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒有這麼簡單的 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.28,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你也真性急
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:03.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,PLANT仍舊表示希望繼續協談
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.13,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,做出了許多動作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:09.47,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,何況還有國家反對聲明和同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.93,0:09:12.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這種情況下不能蠻幹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,之前我也說過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:20.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這種事等PLANT消失都會平靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:24.23,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他們消失後的世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:27.29,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,還有誰能反抗我們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:30.83,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,赤道聯合？ 斯堪的納維亞王國？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.37,0:09:34.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,啊 還是奧布最可怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:38.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那個國家嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.54,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那種小國
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:47.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,世界是個系統
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:51.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,所以需要構築者和管理者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.35,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒有園藝師管理院子就會雜草叢生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:58.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,誰都會在自己的院子裏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:02.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,種喜歡的樹種、鋪上草皮、讓鮮花盛開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.83,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,拔除雜草
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:08.87,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,讓雜草肆無忌禪的生長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這能稱為美觀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:13.63,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說這就是自由
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.63,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.49,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,每個人都喜歡這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:25.84,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,受到規範管理的場所事物 多安全
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:32.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,一直以來 人們不都致力與創造這樣的世界嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:37.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,建造城市 製造工具 樹立規則
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:45.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,而現在正逢前所未有的機遇 對我們來說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:51.86,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,所以儘快掃清他們進入下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:59.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,為了我們Logos的美麗花園
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:03.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,為了新的世界系統構築
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:46.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,等等我 瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:17.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:22.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在我不得不告知全世界的人民
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:26.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,異常重大且令人遺憾的事態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:30.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,對 預備機也都以戰鬥狀態啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:45.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第44戰團 完成搭載機的出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:52.49,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,此刻開始下令FoxTrot作戰轉移至Phase-6
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:55.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,全單位 武器系統全開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:12.65,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,然而至今未得到任何答復
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:18.91,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,對於犯下這前所未有恐怖行為的犯罪團夥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:22.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現任PLANT政權卻一味包庇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:25.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這明顯是對我們的威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.61,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,因此正如前述警告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:30.35,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,地球聯合各國本日淩晨零時起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.45,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,將對其進行武力清除
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:37.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,特此通告PLANT現政權
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:39.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,發佈黃色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.31,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,發佈黃色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,艦內警備 狀態B1
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:46.96,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,以後全面禁止外部人員登艦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:50.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}全部人員請立即進入崗位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.09,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,開戰？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.13,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第一戰鬥群 即將進入戰鬥圈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,全機 武器系統全開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:21.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,叫防衛軍司令官來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,最終防線配置呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.27,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,全市 港口封鎖完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.23,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,警報發佈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,為防發生混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:31.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,下令軍隊的太空梭待機
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:35.59,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就算逃離這裏我們也沒有去處
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.27,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,無論如何都要保住PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:14:59.78,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Sierra Antares1號出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.02,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,發射系統 接合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:06.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到頭來還是變成這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這裏是Sierra Antares1號
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:11.63,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,玖爾隊 伊紮克·玖爾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:12.59,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,玖爾隊 堤亞哥·艾爾斯曼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.37,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Zaku 出動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,本隊 開始戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.01,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,好 一切順利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們也出動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:37.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,容不得調整者的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.86,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這次要給他們個教訓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:10.84,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,地球軍MS隊20
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,向第2區行進中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第三艦群向Orange Delta15行進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:20.35,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,敵軍主力的目標 果然是軍令部和Aprilius嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:22.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但還不確定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:25.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,敵艦的動向 多細小也別放過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.44,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,預警機的報告呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:40.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.33,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,極地軌道預警機來電
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:46.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,敵軍別動隊上標識類型5
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,確認為核導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:48.81,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:49.61,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,數量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.27,0:16:54.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不明 但確認有相當數量的導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:56.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:06.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,全軍 迎擊由極地軌道方向來的敵軍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.43,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他們帶著核武
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.91,0:17:12.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,一顆也別讓他們打中PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,核武攻擊隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.10,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,從極地軌道來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:24.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那這些傢伙...都是誘餌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:30.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,目標 距離射程90
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:31.91,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:40.28,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,全系統狀態正常
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.31,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,量子負能級 通道1至5
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:44.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,波弦座標啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:46.41,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,作用時間7秒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,系統正追蹤目標
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:50.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,一擊定勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:52.23,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,最大限度吸引對方 明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:53.85,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,能量傳輸啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:56.17,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,中子Stampeder啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Red22 Delta 納斯卡級3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:05.72,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但其中一艘帶有不明裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:10.29,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:13.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這次要為藍色清靜的世界而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.14,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,可惡 來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:29.97,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Stampeder照射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:31.00,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,照射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:49.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,第1攻擊隊 消滅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:50.55,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,納斯卡級上發來什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:03.37,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,什麼 到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.68,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,核導彈全數擊破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,核攻擊隊完全消滅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:14.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:18.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Stampeder激發量子負能級
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:19.97,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,啟動斷路器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:22.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在系統機能已停止
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:29.33,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,幸好Stampeder趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但只能解一時之圍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.33,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,下次若再這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:37.32,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,希望能就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:39.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:49.45,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我去洗把臉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:13.25,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:14.81,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.44,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,時間還有多久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那就再確認一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:27.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,拉克絲？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:27.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs32}其實是西貝貨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.28,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:47.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,好高興 你終於來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:56.51,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你怎麼在這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:20:59.22,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.13,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,等你來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:09.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就是說 全軍覆沒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:14.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,核攻擊隊一機不留
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:16.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,屍骨無存的全滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:18.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,轉瞬之間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:22.58,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,地球軍暫時全軍撤往月面基地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:25.84,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼會...不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:28.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:34.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那麼再見
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:38.81,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不過太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.43,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真的好開心 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿雷克斯君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:59.22,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,對了 有安排和你的會見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:03.95,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,讓你久等了 實在抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:05.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:09.41,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.81,0:23:26.19,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,混亂的PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,帶著奇異的既視感
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:31.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,若循環往復就是歷史
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:34.16,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在 自己所在之處又是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這次出現在面前的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:39.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,會是通向理想的道路嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:44.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:46.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,父親的咒縛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:49.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沖向新的世界吧 Savior
